    <statement><p>Find a unit vector <m>\mathbf{e}_\mathbf{v}</m> where <m>\mathbf{v} = \left\lt 5,3,5\right&gt;</m>.</p>
<p><m>\mathbf{e}_\mathbf{v} =</m> <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\left&lt;0.650945,0.390567,0.650945\right&gt;</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <solution><m>\| \mathbf{v} \| = \sqrt{\mathbf{v} \cdotp \mathbf{v}} = \sqrt{5 * 5 + 3 * 3 + 5 * 5} = 7.68115</m>.



<m>\mathbf{e}_\mathbf{v} = \frac{1}{ \| \mathbf{v} \|} \mathbf{v} 
= \left\lt  \frac{5}{7.68115}, \frac{3}{7.68115}, \frac{5}{7.68115} \right&gt; = \left\lt 0.650945,0.390567,0.650945\right&gt;</m>


</solution>
